.TH TDXCTL 1 "2026-09-10" "tdx 0.25" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
tdxctl \- talk to tdx or tdxview over a UNIX socket
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B tdxctl
[\fIOPTIONS\fR]
.I command
[\fIargs\fR...]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B tdxctl
sends one JSON command per invocation (or a keep-alive pipeline with
.BR \-\-ctl )
to
.B tdx (1)
or
.B tdxview (1).
Stdout is product data (screenshot path, dump path, JSON).
Stderr is errors.
.P
Prefer
.B unpause
over
.B run
(F9 toggles).
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help
Print usage and exit.
.TP
.BR \-v ", " \-\-version
Print version and exit.
.TP
.BI \-\-sock " PATH"
Socket path. Default
.I /tmp/tdx.sock
, or
.I /tmp/tdxview.sock
with
.BR \-\-view .
.TP
.B \-\-view
Talk to tdxview (game window shots and keys).
.TP
.B \-\-ctl
Keep-alive: commands on stdin, one connect.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B unpause
Resume execution.
.TP
.B pause , stop
Pause.
.TP
.B run
Toggle F9 run/pause (same as the CPU key).
.TP
.BI delay " [N|+|-]"
F9 slice park in milliseconds. 0 is fastest.
.TP
.B faster , slower
Change delay by 5 ms.
.TP
.B step , step-in
One instruction (into CALL/INT).
.TP
.B over , step-over
Step over CALL, INT, REP, LOOP.
.TP
.B regs , status , cga , ping
JSON status / CGA frame (includes 20-bit
.B linear
).
.TP
.BI setip " seg:off|linear"
Set CS:IP.
.I 0FDB:A360
keeps that segment.
.I 0xFE199
uses the canonical split CS=lin>>4, IP=lin&0xF.
.I .A360
keeps current CS.
.TP
.B getip
Print CS:IP and linear (alias:
.B ip
with no argument).
.TP
.BI "dump cga " [FILE]
16 KiB from B800:0000 to
.I SCREEN.CGA
(default).
.TP
.BI "dump mda " [FILE]
4 KiB from B000:0000 to
.I SCREEN.MDA
(default).
.TP
.BI "dump " "seg:off len [FILE]"
Arbitrary range.
.TP
.BI "key " KEY
Inject a DOS INT 16h key (starts run).
.TP
.BI "shot " [path]
Screenshot; stdout is the versioned path.
.TP
.B bp , bpint , bpinsn , bpm , bpdel , bplist
Breakpoints (see
.B tdxctl \-h
for full forms).
.TP
.BI "floppy " "a|b PATH"
Replace drive A: or B: with a new image (or host directory) without
resetting the CPU. M1 Tank Platoon: A: stays DOS, B: swaps
.I DISK01.IMG
/
.I DISK02.IMG
when the game asks for DISK B.
.TP
.B quit
Ask tdx to exit.
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B 0
Success.
.TP
.B 1
Socket or protocol error.
.TP
.B 2
Bad command line.
.SH EXAMPLES
Dump CGA VRAM:
.RS
.B tdxctl dump cga
.RE
Unpause at 0 ms delay:
.RS
.B tdxctl delay 0
.br
.B tdxctl unpause
.RE
Swap B: to M1TP disk 2:
.RS
.B tdxctl floppy b /path/DISK02.IMG
.RE
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR tdx (1),
.BR tdxview (1)
